{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101950","id":2293807633,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6IuLoR","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101950","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101950.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101950.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101950","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101950/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101950/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101950/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/21fc5cce5ccfd844ef507b2754242ecd3ebe4435","number":101950,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Use `LocalVector<Glyph>` in `TextServerAdvanced` to reduce reallocation","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"As I stated in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101882#issuecomment-2607076532, `TextServerAdvanced::glyphs` contributes a lot of heap reallocations via `push_back` calls. An ideal solution would be reserving enough space before the loop but unfortunately the control flow here is quite complex and I do not obtain enough domain specific knowledge to determin which branch is used most often. So instead I change the `Vector` to `LocalVector` to benifit from default x2 resizing behaviour.\r\n\r\nI check the code and can confirm that COW is not needed here. Only one reference to `glyphs` includes COW copy but that one is  followed by an immediate sorting which triggers the duplication anyway.\r\n\r\nPerformance gain is rather small, this patch saves about 1s in #101882's MRP from 22s on my PC. Some screenshots to show we are actually doing less reallocation:\r\nmaster:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f88c3dbe-975a-419d-9a8a-d2411d3b5670)\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bd457cc1-e36b-41bb-b433-151f75a080e2)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/